# **A FORD ACROSS THE MIDDLE, AND DRY GROUND EITHER SIDE OF IT.** The whole creature is a question about
# whether you are in a hurry, so the map has to offer both answers: the channel is the short way and the ends
# of it are open, so walking round is always available and always slower. Dug to about 0.79 m — well over
# `fenlurker.WADE_MIN` (0.30) so it feels him, and well under `env.WADE_MAX` (1.37) so he is not refused.
